config WS73_WIFI_KUNIT_TEST
	tristate "WS73 Wi-Fi configuration codec tests" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on KUNIT
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Check bounded byte-oriented FRW configuration encoding and reply
	  parsing in a hardware-free VM. No adapter or USB consumer is
	  registered. These tests do not qualify the original firmware ABI,
	  radio, security or Wi-Fi connectivity.
